---
// Shown on every Security+ page while SY0-801 and SY0-701 overlap. Remove the SY0-701 line once 701 retires (June 11, 2027).
// The launch wording switches from "is set to launch" to "launched" on its own at build time, using track.json.
import track from '../../data/security-plus/track.json';
interface Props { changes?: string }
const { changes } = Astro.props;
const launched = new Date() >= new Date(`${track.launch}T00:00:00Z`);
---
<div class="callout warn">
  <strong>Exam version:</strong> these notes follow <strong>SY0-801</strong> (V8), which CompTIA {launched ? 'launched' : 'is set to launch'} on or around November 17, 2026. The older <strong>SY0-701</strong> (V7) stays available in English until June 11, 2027 (Japanese, Portuguese, Spanish and Thai until August 13, 2027). Book the version you studied for.
  {changes && <p><strong>What's different from SY0-701 in this domain:</strong> {changes}</p>}
</div>
